          9056dfb06ebc9bb6 t("Every colour drawn over another is a role at one of seven strengths, as every space is one of six steps. About twenty places move to the nearest step, the 27 measured by at most 0.034 in Oklab, near the least the eye tells apart. A filled button's 85% and 70%, and Windows' caption buttons' 6% and 4%, are states, settled with Components. A test refuses a strength that isn't a step.",SF Pro Text,12,r,align(l),lh(auto,1.17),ls(0px)) p(12,184.5) s(fill,hug:126) ext(261.33,) f[(c764f37719374f3d,tok(color.text.muted,#B8B1AC))] $typography.Detail "Cost"
