          20aa2f4ae68c59a1 t("An open pull request stays as GitHub draws it, so it looks as it does on GitHub. Two greens 0.082 apart in Oklab sit side by side wherever a pull request is beside a diff's counts or something done, and the bar's words read at Lc 50.",SF Pro Text,12,r,align(l),lh(auto,1.17),ls(0px)) p(12,42.5) s(fill,hug:56) ext(410,) f[(8ee64e7f2154815d,tok(color.text.muted,#B8B1AC))] $typography.Detail "Cost"
